{"abstract":[{"text":"Receive the credentials a Credential Offer offers, with either grant,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and look after them once they’re held.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Receiving-credentials","generated":true,"title":"Receiving credentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredStatus"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An issuer offers credentials with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" link,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a QR code or a link the holder opens. Register the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer"},{"type":"text","text":" URL scheme in the app’s Info.plist so links"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"open the app, and hand the link to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startIssuance(offer:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resolves the offer and the issuer’s metadata, and returns an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/offer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" you show the holder: who is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offering what."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The offer names one of two grants:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Authorization code:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the holder signs in at the issuer’s pages, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a browser, which redirects back to the wallet’s redirect URI."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pre-authorized code:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the issuer has already authenticated the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder, and may ask for a PIN it sent them separately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer\/txCode-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Either way, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" then requests, checks and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stores the credentials, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/close()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ends the issuance."}]},{"text":"Receive an offer","anchor":"Receive-an-offer","type":"heading","level":3},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import AuthenticationServices","import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Receives the credentials an offer link offers. `confirm` shows the","\/\/\/ holder who is offering what, and returns whether they want it;","\/\/\/ `askPIN` asks for the PIN the issuer sent, or returns nil if they","\/\/\/ cancel; `signIn` opens the issuer's page and returns the redirect","\/\/\/ back.","func receive(offerLink: String, wallet: Wallet,","             confirm: (Offer) async -> Bool,","             askPIN: (Offer.TxCode?) async -> String?,","             signIn: (URL) async throws -> URL) async throws -> Issuance.Result? {","    let issuance = try await wallet.startIssuance(offer: offerLink)","    do {","        guard await confirm(issuance.offer) else {","            try await issuance.close()","            return nil","        }","        switch issuance.offer.grant {","        case .preAuthorizedCode:","            while true {","                guard let pin = await askPIN(issuance.offer.txCode) else {","                    try await issuance.close()","                    return nil","                }","                do {","                    try await issuance.redeemPreAuthorizedCode(pin: pin)","                    break","                } catch let error as WalletError where error.isRetryable {","                    continue \/\/ A wrong PIN (invalid_grant): ask again.","                }","            }","        case .authorizationCode:","            let url = try await issuance.beginAuthorization()","            let redirect = try await signIn(url)","            try await issuance.completeAuthorization(redirect: redirect)","        }","        let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","        try await issuance.close()","        return result","    } catch {","        \/\/ End the issuance whatever failed, deleting its keys.","        try? await issuance.close()","        throw error","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Show the offer before anything is redeemed: the issuer’s name and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials it offers, so the holder can turn down an offer they didn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"expect. Close the issuance on every path, as here: its keys are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deleted then, but for those a deferred credential still needs."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/Result","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists what arrived, what the issuer deferred, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what failed: one credential the issuer refused doesn’t hold up the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest."}]},{"text":"Open the issuer’s page","anchor":"Open-the-issuers-page","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Open the authorization URL in an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ASWebAuthenticationSession"},{"text":", with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"redirect URI’s scheme as its callback scheme. An ephemeral session","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps the issuer’s cookies out of Safari’s.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/\/ Opens issuers' authorization pages over `window`.","@MainActor","final class IssuerSignIn: NSObject, ASWebAuthenticationPresentationContextProviding {","    private let window: ASPresentationAnchor","    private let callbackScheme: String","","    init(window: ASPresentationAnchor, callbackScheme: String) {","        self.window = window","        self.callbackScheme = callbackScheme","    }","","    nonisolated func presentationAnchor(for session: ASWebAuthenticationSession) -> ASPresentationAnchor {","        MainActor.assumeIsolated { window }","    }","","    \/\/\/ The issuer's redirect back, or `ASWebAuthenticationSessionError`","    \/\/\/ `.canceledLogin` when the holder closes the page.","    func open(_ url: URL) async throws -> URL {","        try await withCheckedThrowingContinuation { continuation in","            let session = ASWebAuthenticationSession(url: url, callbackURLScheme: callbackScheme) { redirect, error in","                if let redirect {","                    continuation.resume(returning: redirect)","                } else {","                    continuation.resume(throwing: error ?? URLError(.unknown))","                }","            }","            session.presentationContextProvider = self","            session.prefersEphemeralWebBrowserSession = true","            session.start()","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If the holder closes the page, the offer stays open:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/beginAuthorization()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" can begin again. A redirect is used","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"up by "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/completeAuthorization(redirect:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whatever happens,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"so after a failure there, begin again rather than retrying it.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Resume after the app is killed","anchor":"Resume-after-the-app-is-killed","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS can terminate the app while the holder is at the issuer’s pages.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The authorization in progress is kept in the credential store, so when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the redirect arrives at a relaunched app, ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/resumeIssuance(redirect:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"completes it and returns an issuance ready for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". Handle every redirect this way: in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SwiftUI, from ","type":"text"},{"code":"onOpenURL","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Outside development, resuming needs a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"redirectURI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with the app’s own URI scheme, such as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.example.wallet:\/callback","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so ","type":"text"},{"code":"Wallet","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" refuses an https Universal","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Link there. In development too, the scheme must be a domain name in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reverse order followed by a single slash, ","type":"text"},{"code":"reverse.domain:\/path","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(RFC 8252 §7.1): ","type":"text"},{"code":"Wallet","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" refuses ","type":"text"},{"code":"myapp:\/callback","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.example.wallet:\/\/callback","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.example.wallet:callback","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"invalidInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and any redirect URI with a fragment or credentials.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/\/ Completes an authorization the app was killed during, from the","\/\/\/ redirect iOS delivers to the relaunched app.","func resume(redirect: URL, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> Issuance.Result {","    let issuance = try await wallet.resumeIssuance(redirect: redirect)","    let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","    try await issuance.close()","    return result","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A redirect that matches no authorization in progress throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/notFound","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Wait for a deferred credential","anchor":"Wait-for-a-deferred-credential","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An issuer may issue a credential later, after a review, say. It’s kept","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the credential store until it’s issued, denied or abandoned, so it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"survives the app quitting. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deferredCredentials()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" lists them","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without network requests; poll each at the interval the issuer asks for.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/\/ Polls a deferred credential until the issuer settles it: the","\/\/\/ credential, or a `.credentialDenied` error.","func waitFor(_ deferred: DeferredCredential, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> CredentialSummary {","    var interval = deferred.intervalSeconds","    while true {","        try await Task.sleep(for: .seconds(max(interval, 5)))","        switch try await wallet.pollDeferred(id: deferred.id) {","        case .issued(let credential): return credential","        case .pending(let next): interval = next","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/abandonDeferred(id:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" gives one up, deleting its keys: once","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its access token has expired, say (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential\/accessTokenExpiresAt","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Look after held credentials","anchor":"Look-after-held-credentials","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credentials()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists them, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credential(id:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns one with its claims, for display. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/display","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carries the issuer’s names, logos and colours, in the holder’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"language ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/locales","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/checkStatus(id:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" checks revocation against the issuer’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"status list, which covers many credentials, so the issuer can’t tell"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which one is checked."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each credential arrives as a batch of copies, each bound to its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), so presentations can’t be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"linked by the credential. When "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reaches zero, ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/refreshCredential(id:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" replaces them, if the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issuance kept a refresh token ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Otherwise it throws ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/reissueRequired","isActive":true},{"text":": receive the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credential again. A refresh needs no sign-in, but the new copies’","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder keys sign the Credential Request’s proof, so with","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderUserPresence","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asks the holder too."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deleteCredential(id:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" deletes a credential and its keys,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"revoking its refresh token at the issuer.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"article","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"title":"Receiving credentials","role":"article"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/receivingcredentials"]}],"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/abandonDeferred(id:)":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/abandondeferred(id:)","title":"abandonDeferred(id:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"abandonDeferred"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Gives up on a deferred credential — its access token has expired,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"say, or the holder no longer wants it — deleting it and its keys.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/abandonDeferred(id:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/DeferredStatus":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/deferredstatus","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A deferred credential’s state, from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet.pollDeferred(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DeferredStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DeferredStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredStatus","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"DeferredStatus"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance/beginAuthorization()":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/issuance\/beginauthorization()","title":"beginAuthorization()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"beginAuthorization","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"URL","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Begins the authorization code grant, returning the issuer’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"authorization URL to open in an ","type":"text"},{"code":"ASWebAuthenticationSession","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Calling it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again begins again: after the holder closed the page, say.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/beginAuthorization()"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/notFound":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/notfound","title":"notFound","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notFound","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletError","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Code","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"No key, credential, deferred credential or authorization in progress","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with that ID.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/notFound"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialSummary/display":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialsummary\/display","title":"display","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"display","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CredentialDisplay","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet17CredentialDisplayV"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How to show it, from the issuer’s metadata when it was received."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/display"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/issuance","title":"Issuance","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Issuance","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Issuance","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Receives one offer’s credentials: show ","type":"text"},{"code":"offer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"beginAuthorization()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", open the URL in ASWebAuthenticationSession and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"completeAuthorization(redirect:)"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"redeemPreAuthorizedCode(pin:)"},{"type":"text","text":";"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"requestCredentials()"},{"type":"text","text":"; "},{"code":"close()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when done."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/credentials()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credentials()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"credentials","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"CredentialSummary","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet17CredentialSummaryV"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Every credential the wallet holds.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/credentials()","type":"topic","title":"credentials()","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/refreshCredential(id:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/refreshCredential(id:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"refreshCredential"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Refreshed","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet6WalletC9RefreshedV"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Replaces a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"refreshable"},{"text":" credential’s copies with a fresh batch,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each bound to a new holder key, without the holder signing in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(OpenID4VCI 1.0 §13.5). The new holder keys sign the Credential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Request’s proof, so with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyStore.Options.holderUserPresence"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on it asks the holder. Use it when ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"copiesLeft"},{"text":" runs low. Throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WalletError.Code.reissueRequired"},{"text":" when it can’t be refreshed:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"receive it again from a new offer.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/refreshcredential(id:)","type":"topic","title":"refreshCredential(id:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/requestRefresh":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/requestrefresh","title":"requestRefresh","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requestRefresh","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Asks Authorization Servers for a refresh token, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet.refreshCredential(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":" can later replace a credential’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"copies without the holder signing in. The server must allow the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wallet the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"offline_access"},{"type":"text","text":" scope, or the authorization fails."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Offer/txCode-swift.property":{"role":"symbol","url"