orization with the issuer’s redirect back. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"redirect is used up whatever happens: if this fails — the token","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request didn’t get through, say — call ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"beginAuthorization()"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again, rather than retrying this.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/completeAuthorization(redirect:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Offer":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Offer","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Offer","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"What a Credential Offer offers.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/offer","type":"topic","title":"Offer","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/deleteCredential(id:)":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/deletecredential(id:)","title":"deleteCredential(id:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"deleteCredential"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Deletes a credential and its holder keys, and its refresh grant","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"once no other credential uses it, first revoking the refresh token","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"at the Authorization Server, best effort.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deleteCredential(id:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/holderUserPresence":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/holderuserpresence","abstract":[{"text":"Require user presence (Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode) for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every signature with a holder key: to present a credential,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and to sign the Credential Request’s jwt proofs, so receiving","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and refreshing credentials ask too — once per copy","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), or once per Credential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Request when its jwt proof carries a key attestation — and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refresh can’t run without the holder. The Secure Enclave","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enforces it. Off, the app asks for it itself (with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"LAContext.evaluatePolicy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") before every presentation — in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the app, from a link, through a document provider extension,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and in person — a check the app’s own code keeps, not the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key. For Face ID, the app’s Info.plist must have an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; without one, iOS asks for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passcode instead.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"holderUserPresence"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderUserPresence","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"holderUserPresence"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","abstract":[{"text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","type":"topic","title":"OID4VCWallet","role":"collection"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/checkStatus(id:)":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/checkstatus(id:)","title":"checkStatus(id:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkStatus","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CredentialSummary","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet17CredentialSummaryV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Fetches the issuer’s status list for a credential, checks its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"signature, and returns the credential with its revocation status","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"recorded. The list covers many credentials, so fetching it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t tell the issuer which one is checked. A credential without","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a status list is returned as it is.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/checkStatus(id:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/reissueRequired":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/reissuerequired","title":"reissueRequired","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reissueRequired","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletError","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Code","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A credential can’t be refreshed: no refresh token was kept, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Authorization Server no longer accepts it. Receive it again","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from a new offer.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/reissueRequired"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/deferredCredentials()":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/deferredcredentials()","title":"deferredCredentials()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deferredCredentials","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"DeferredCredential","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet18DeferredCredentialV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The credentials issuers have deferred and not yet settled, oldest","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first — including ones from before the app last quit. Makes no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"network calls: poll each at its interval.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deferredCredentials()"}}}